canon: LAYOUT_MIGRATION_REQUIRED: spec root `root` (`specs`) is on the pre-0.17 layout (`features/kind=feature/area=cart/add.feature` sits under `features/`); canon reads `kind=feature/area=<area>/<surface>.feature` directly under the root, and `canon migrate` moves `features/kind=feature/` there; nothing written
  hint: run `canon migrate` to move the repository to the current layout
